{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The reproduced frame establishes the controllable avatar experimentally: the compact color-9 block moves with actions 2/3 while the compact color-14 block advances independently on each successful turn. `USE` only has a contextual effect after movement: it resets both actors and advances a three-slot header, so level 6 is a round-based race/staging mechanic, not an unlock maze. I’m testing the shrinking bottom meter and round outcomes next, keeping actor heading in the search key because identical positions can have different next transitions."}}
